# ─── Agent runtime output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Written by the observability plugin's SubagentStart/Stop hooks. Must be ignored:
# an untracked journal makes `git status` dirty after the first subagent, and the
# agent-teams idle gate blocks a teammate on exactly that.
data/agent-journal.jsonl
# Strike-counters of the team gates. NOT ignoring them makes the tree dirty
# after the first block, and the TeammateIdle gate then fires on its own
# artefact — the same trap the journal line above fixes.
data/team-gates/
# Per-stage token metering of /dev:pipeline (opt-in Stop-hook).
data/pipeline-metrics.jsonl

